  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. • Finely chop garlic. • Cut pumpkin into bite-sized chunks. TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer and scrape out the seeds, if necessary!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68a7f0057e1f6c64ca67e1bc/step-4173e000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. • Spread out evenly, then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68a7f0057e1f6c64ca67e1bc/step-09786310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While the pumpkin is roasting, in a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook green beans, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a plate. • SPICY! This is a mild curry paste, but use less if you&#39;re sensitive to heat! Return saucepan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add Bengal curry paste (see ingredients), Mumbai spice blend and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.</p> <p>TIP: If you ordered trimmed green beans, no need to prep — save the whole ones for another meal!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68a7f0057e1f6c64ca67e1bc/step-06e0a920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Add basmati rice and currants to the pan and stir to coat. • Add the water and salt. Stir, then bring to the boil. • Cover with a lid and reduce heat to medium-low. Cook for 12 minutes, then remove pan from the heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 15 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don&#39;t peek!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68a7f0057e1f6c64ca67e1bc/step-ba02d530.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When the rice is done, add baby spinach leaves and green beans to the pilaf and stir until leaves are just wilted. • Season to taste with salt and pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68a7f0057e1f6c64ca67e1bc/step-80e53c40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide golden Bengali biryani between bowls. • Top with roasted pumpkin. • Dollop with Greek-style yoghurt. Garnish with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68a7f0057e1f6c64ca67e1bc/step-a9381650.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
